                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eebcbbd7-3193-31b5-b684-1d79e48cad3d",
                        "entry_id": "e733825d-abb0-38a0-9dfc-d791ad0d859c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Roche imaginaire, radioactive, d’origine météoritique pouvant affecter Superman, autrement invulnérable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fiction"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42b94a91-a282-4e61-9e1b-e6d5074a759c",
                                "sense_id": "eebcbbd7-3193-31b5-b684-1d79e48cad3d",
                                "text": "La kryptonite a tout d’abord été inventée non pas dans la version des magazines, mais dans l’émission de radio «The Adventures of Superman» en juin 1943, cette matière dangereuse sera intégrée dans les comics en novembre 1949."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "70fac4ef-c2ca-3954-929a-4cf5ac4617b2",
                        "entry_id": "e733825d-abb0-38a0-9dfc-d791ad0d859c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tout élément qui neutralise un pouvoir ou constitue un point faible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b8ac69b-f3cb-4e30-bb9f-bc40deb83a44",
                                "sense_id": "70fac4ef-c2ca-3954-929a-4cf5ac4617b2",
                                "text": "Le problème majeur du traitement de l’allongement compensatoire dans une théorie paralléliste provient donc du Poids par Position, qui possède les mêmes effets sur l’allongement compensatoire que la kryptonite sur Superman en ce qu’elle inhibe l’expression de son pouvoir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bbe3d83-50ee-4222-a08b-c3fe0f971ae3",
                                "sense_id": "70fac4ef-c2ca-3954-929a-4cf5ac4617b2",
                                "text": "Les deux aspirants premiers ministres en sont à leur premier test électoral, traînant chacun son lot de kryptonite."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "897e6aa2-4d3a-47f2-a3fb-ea8954f71124",
                        "source_entry_id": "e733825d-abb0-38a0-9dfc-d791ad0d859c",
                        "target_lang_word": "kryptonite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kryptonite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a87f50c1-eed0-3689-9688-872570cd3a5d",
                                        "entry_id": "21d94e81-0568-352e-921a-b75b6f653520",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The one weakness of something or someone that is otherwise invulnerable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cc1b5cd-8283-43d3-99a9-6662f59742e2",
                                                "sense_id": "a87f50c1-eed0-3689-9688-872570cd3a5d",
                                                "text": "The terrific seven-grain bread here is the kryptonite of restaurant reviewers: two mini-loaves and you are incapacitated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22e65bec-24f0-4865-b9a0-b8820c217986",
                                                "sense_id": "a87f50c1-eed0-3689-9688-872570cd3a5d",
                                                "text": "So while recording or sampling a Charlie Manson track […] makes for shock rock kudos aplenty, a devotion to Hubbard is kryptonite for credibility."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "166a4c38-6699-496a-be98-fd1b52bb7b95",
                                                "sense_id": "a87f50c1-eed0-3689-9688-872570cd3a5d",
                                                "text": "We all have our own kryptonite or kryptonites, so don't tempt yourself by listening to so-called friends who are just demonic tools being used to bring you under."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f26a5ad6-e6b6-4fd7-acf2-be91f31490f2",
                                                "sense_id": "a87f50c1-eed0-3689-9688-872570cd3a5d",
                                                "text": "But of course porn is kryptonite to many investors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4376ef70-2706-3c20-96f3-869745597880",
                                        "entry_id": "21d94e81-0568-352e-921a-b75b6f653520",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Crack cocaine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "kryptonite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a041b71a-ccca-377f-9ad1-b86f39b5209c",
                                        "entry_id": "9878634f-5419-3688-8ce6-87e23daa70af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To expose to, or attack with, kryptonite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e4f4642-60e4-43c4-8a98-e1dba7287cdd",
                                                "sense_id": "a041b71a-ccca-377f-9ad1-b86f39b5209c",
                                                "text": "And even those two were pretty puny, like Superman after he had been kryptonited."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c729f149-e65a-371a-8db9-c446815177de",
